    turnFlow: "1. Folding: After seeing their tiles and trumps, players can 'fold' and sit out the round to avoid penalties.\n2. The Dummy: A player can choose to play by discarding their hand and taking the 'dummy' hand.\n3. Trick Play: Lead any tile. Must follow suit. If unable to follow, you can play ANY tile (no requirement to trump unless you wish to).\n4. Winning: Highest trump wins. If no trump, highest of led suit wins.",
